The smallest signal can still reveal the whole system if you track where it goes. A penny becomes a probe; a wording choice becomes a behavioral cue; a tiny organizational delay exposes an interface defect; one repeated preference reveals an attractor.

And the pun carries another layer: follow the cent / follow the scent. Track the faint trace rather than waiting for a giant obvious signal.

Pantheon compression:

cent → signal → trail → structure → mechanism → leverage

Or:

Follow what is cheap enough to ignore but persistent enough to matter.

